# Local-only CA certs for the corporate-proxy hook (see README.md). Two consumers:
# the frontend Dockerfile `base` stage installs any *.crt dropped here into the image
# trust store so `next build` can fetch fonts through a TLS-inspection proxy, and the
# Makefile's `ca-bundle` target merges them with certifi's roots so the backend's F7
# price feeds (AMFI / Yahoo) verify too.
# NEVER commit a real corporate CA — only this dir's docs stay tracked, and the
# source-packaging script (scripts/package_source.py) strips certs from the zip too.
*
!.gitignore
!README.md
